WEBVTT

00:05:29.825 --> 00:05:31.452
But then it happened.

00:05:31.827 --> 00:05:34.872
In September 2016,

00:05:34.914 --> 00:05:38.584
the Israeli government launched
Operation Good Neighbor.

00:05:38.626 --> 00:05:43.255
It was now official government policy
to open the border

00:05:43.297 --> 00:05:47.802
so that aid from other countries
could be facilitated

00:05:47.843 --> 00:05:49.512
and sent in to Syria.

00:05:51.639 --> 00:05:54.725
So soon after,

00:05:54.725 --> 00:05:59.855
once we were able to get
Operation Good Neighbor going,

00:05:59.897 --> 00:06:03.734
soon after, enormous cargo
containers of aid --